       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CORRESPONDING.
       AUTHOR.JU.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 WS-EMP-INPUT.
          05 EMP-ID       PIC 9(5) VALUE 12345.
          05 EMP-NAME     PIC X(10) VALUE "VIJAY".
          05 EMP-SALARY   PIC 9(6) VALUE 50000.
       01 WS-EMP-OUTPUT.
          05 EMP-ID       PIC 9(5).
          05 EMP-NAME     PIC X(10).
          05 EMP-SALARY   PIC 9(6).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           MOVE CORRESPONDING WS-EMP-INPUT
             TO WS-EMP-OUTPUT

           DISPLAY EMP-ID OF WS-EMP-OUTPUT
           DISPLAY EMP-NAME OF WS-EMP-OUTPUT
           DISPLAY EMP-SALARY OF WS-EMP-OUTPUT
           STOP RUN.
